# Demo knowledge pack - causal & part-whole chains (lesson 02)
# 'causes' and 'is_part_of' are transitive: the system closes the chain
# with decreasing confidence per step. Ask: causes(rain) or is_part_of(cell).

# Causal chain
rain causes wet_ground
wet_ground causes mud
mud causes slippery_road
slippery_road causes accidents

# Part-whole chain
a_cell is_part_of a_tissue
a_tissue is_part_of an_organ
an_organ is_part_of a_body
a_body is_part_of an_organism

# Mixed properties
the_sun shows light
the_sun shows heat
ice shows cold
